# Idris 2: Idris 2 documentation, the reference (syntax, keywords); requirements/languages/idris.md
name     idris idr idris2

keyword  module import data record interface implementation where let in do case of if then else total
keyword  partial covering public export private namespace mutual parameters using auto impossible with
keyword  rewrite proof
type     Type Nat Int Integer String Bool List Maybe IO Char Double
builtin  True False Nothing Just Z S putStrLn printLn pure map

ident-part     '
line-comment   --
block-comment  {- -}  : nested
string   " "  : escapes
escape        : x=2
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.\$
upper-type
hook     apostrophe
